PAGE RESENDS
TITLE Missing parts and the resend queue
KIND topic
SCREENS RESENDS
SEE FORM-PARTS_ASK FORM-PARTS_QUEUE FORM-PARTS_REPEAT EMCON
BEGIN_TEXT
Long key tapes and bundles go in numbered parts. A member missing some
asks for them by number (PARTS_ASK).

At net control the asks pool into one queue. A part several members
missed goes once to the whole net; a part one member missed goes to that
member. The queue shows as one line, such as "7 sends for 20 stations",
and goes with one press, now or at the next net slot (PARTS_QUEUE).

At most 12 resends go in an hour. A member who asks again for a part
already sent twice is flagged: look into their antenna or path, then send
it by hand if you choose (PARTS_REPEAT).
END
